### ===== AUTH FLOW TESTS =====
### IntelliJ HTTP Client - click on the green ▶ next to each request

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Register a BUSINESS user
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sebi Sava",
  "email": "sebi@test.com",
  "password": "parola123",
  "role": "BUSINESS"
}

### 2. Register a regular USER
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Pop",
  "email": "maria@test.com",
  "password": "parola123",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 3. Register an ONG
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Banca de Alimente",
  "email": "ong@test.com",
  "password": "parola123",
  "role": "ONG"
}

### 4. Login - saves token for next requests
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sebi@test.com",
  "password": "parola123"
}

### 5. Try to register with duplicate email (should fail with 500 -> later 409 if you add @RestControllerAdvice)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate",
  "email": "sebi@test.com",
  "password": "parola123",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 6. Login with wrong password (should return 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sebi@test.com",
  "password": "gresit999"
}

### 7. Validation error - invalid email format (should return 400)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "parola123",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 8. Validation error - password too short (min 8 chars)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad",
  "email": "short@test.com",
  "password": "abc",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 9. Test protected endpoint (should be 401 without token)
GET {{host}}/api/some-future-protected-endpoint

### 10. Test protected endpoint with token (still 404 since endpoint doesn't exist - but you'll see 401 vs 404 difference)
GET {{host}}/api/some-future-protected-endpoint
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
